OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly and dry start with
OL,6,Flong sunny spells for Dumfries,
OL,7,FLothian and Borders. However showers
OL,8,Facross Galloway gradually spread east
OL,9,Fthrough the day, with the odd heavy
OL,10,Fone possible. Winds turning
OL,11,Fnorthwesterly and freshening.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers die out through the
OL,14,Fevening and winds ease. With long
OL,15,Fclear spells developing it will be a
OL,16,Fchilly night with a risk of frost in
OL,17,Fsheltered spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
