OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA chilly start to a dry
OL,6,Fmorning with long sunny spells.
OL,7,FIncreasing cloud brings rain to
OL,8,Fwestern parts by mid-afternoon and all
OL,9,Fby evening, the rain becoming heavy in
OL,10,Fwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,13,FOccasionally heavy rain soon clearing
OL,14,FFriday morning then sunny spells and
OL,15,Fblustery showers, these becoming
OL,16,Fheavier Saturday with northwesterly
OL,17,Fcoastal gales. Mainly dry and bright
OL,18,Fon Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
